'''Enchanted Weapons''' is a round 3 or 10 [[skill]] that gives the attack effects of the {{icon/star}} [[weapon|weapons]] a chance to repeat. It also occasionally gives you one of a buff you have the least of.

By "attack effect," it refers to an On Hit or On Attack effect of a weapon. This does not apply to effects that would likely be negative to the player, such as the attack effect of the [[Phoenix]] which causes the player to lose health.

